  "files": [
    {
      "path": "index.html",
      "content": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n  <title>Pixel Counter</title>\n  <link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"style.css\">\n</head>\n<body>\n  <main class=\"card\">\n    <h1 class=\"title\">Pixel Counter</h1>\n    <output id=\"count\" class=\"count\" aria-live=\"polite\">0</output>\n    <div class=\"controls\">\n      <button id=\"decrease\" class=\"btn\" aria-label=\"Decrease count by one\">−</button>\n      <button id=\"reset\" class=\"btn\" aria-label=\"Reset count to zero\">Reset</button>\n      <button id=\"increase\" class=\"btn\" aria-label=\"Increase count by one\">+</button>\n    </div>\n  </main>\n  <script src=\"script.js\"></script>\n</body>\n</html>",
      "description": ""
    },
    {
      "path": "style.css",
      "content": ":root {\n  --bg: #1a1c2c;\n  --card: #29366f;\n  --accent: #41a6f6;\n  --text: #f4f4f4;\n  --edge: #566c86;\n}\n\n* {\n  box-sizing: border-box;\n  margin: 0;\n  padding: 0;\n}\n\nbody {\n  min-height: 100vh;\n  display: flex;\n  align-items: center;\n  justify-content: center;\n  background: var(--bg);\n  font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, sans-serif;\n  font-size: 18px;\n  padding: 16px;\n}\n\n.card {\n  background: var(--card);\n  padding: 32px 24px;\n  border-radius: 0;\n  box-shadow: 0 0 0 4px var(--edge), 0 0 0 8px var(--bg), 0 12px 24px rgba(0,0,0,0.5);\n  text-align: center;\n  width: 100%;\n  max-width: 360px;\n  image-rendering: pixelated;\n}\n\n.title {\n  color: var(--text);\n  font-size: 1.25rem;\n  letter-spacing: 2px;\n  text-transform: uppercase;\n  margin-bottom: 24px;\n  text-shadow: 2px 2px 0 var(--bg);\n}\n\n.count {\n  display: block;\n  color: var(--accent);\n  font-size: 4rem;\n  font-weight: 700;\n  line-height: 1;\n  margin-bottom: 32px;\n  font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums;\n  text-shadow: 4px 4px 0 var(--bg);\n  word-break: break-all;\n}\n\n.controls {\n  display: flex;\n  gap: 12px;\n  justify-content: center;\n  flex-wrap: wrap;\n}\n\n.btn {\n  font-family: inherit;\n  font-size: 1.25rem;\n  font-weight: 700;\n  color: var(--text);\n  background: var(--edge);\n  border: none;\n  padding: 12px 20px;\n  min-width: 64px;\n  cursor: pointer;\n  transition: transform 0.05s, background 0.15s;\n  box-shadow: 0 4px 0 var(--bg);\n}\n\n.btn:hover {\n  background: var(--accent);\n  color: var(--bg);\n}\n\n.btn:focus-visible {\n  outline: 3px solid var(--accent);\n  outline-offset: 3px;\n}\n\n.btn:active {\n  transform: translateY(4px);\n  box-shadow: none;\n}\n\n@media (max-width: 400px) {\n  .card { padding: 24px 16px; }\n  .count { font-size: 3rem; }\n  .btn { padding: 10px 16px; min-width: 56px; }\n}",
      "description": ""
    },
    {
      "path": "script.js",
      "content": "const countEl = document.getElementById('count');\nlet value = 0;\n\nfunction render() {\n  countEl.textContent = value;\n}\n\ndocument.getElementById('increase').addEventListener('click', () => {\n  value += 1;\n  render();\n});\n\ndocument.getElementById('decrease').addEventListener('click', () => {\n  value -= 1;\n  render();\n});\n\ndocument.getElementById('reset').addEventListener('click', () => {\n  value = 0;\n  render();\n});\n\nrender();",
      "description": ""
    },
    {
      "path": "README.md",
      "content": "# Offline Pixel-Style Counter\n\nA dependency-free, offline browser counter with a retro pixel aesthetic.\n\n## Features\n\n- Starts at 0\n- Increase (+1), decrease (−1), and reset to 0\n- Supports negative numbers\n- Keyboard-accessible labeled buttons\n- No network requests, storage, or external assets\n- Responsive down to 360px wide\n\n## Usage\n\nOpen `index.html` in any modern browser. Click the buttons or use Tab + Enter/Space to interact.\n\n## Files\n\n- `index.html` — markup and structure\n- `style.css` — pixel-themed styling\n- `script.js` — counter logic\n\n## Accessibility\n\nButtons have `aria-label` attributes and visible focus states. The count is announced via `aria-live=\"polite\"`.\n\n## Offline\n\nNo imports, packages, or network requests. Works entirely offline.",
      "description": ""
    }
  ]
